    "sentence_translations": [
      "I Don’t Want Money",
      "",
      "Today at midday, Mom ate a lot of food and a lot of dishes.",
      "I also ate a lot of things that dad had bought for me, and they were delicious.",
      "",
      "“Finished. Excuse me, waiter Dabei, how much is it?” Mom asked Dad with a smile.",
      "",
      "“I don’t want money,” said Dad.",
      "",
      "“You don’t want money?” Mom asked, “Then what do you want?”",
      "",
      "“I want your time.”",
      "Dad smiled, “Excuse me, our beautiful Miss Gao Xiaoyue, can you give me some time in the afternoon and evening?”",
      "",
      "“Okay!” Mom smiled, “Go ahead, my Mr. Dabei, tell me what you want to do in the afternoon and evening?”",
      "",
      "“At midday, I want to go and buy clothes with you. You have too few clothes.",
      "We will go to the movies in the afternoon. We will eat out in the evening. How does that sound?”",
      "",
      "“Okay! I will do what you say.” Mom looked at Dad. She was very happy.",
      ""
